---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Contact Antoine | Savor & Stories"
  description="Message Antoine directly on WhatsApp to book a tour in Bordeaux or Dieppe, or ask a question first."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow={{ en: 'Contact', fr: 'Contact', es: 'Contacto' }}
    title={{ en: 'Contact & Booking Help', fr: 'Contact & Aide à la réservation', es: 'Contacto y ayuda para reservar' }}
    line={{ en: 'Every booking goes straight through to me, personally.', fr: "Chaque réservation arrive directement jusqu'à moi, personnellement.", es: 'Cada reserva llega directamente a mí, en persona.' }}
  />

  <div class="max-w-[600px] md:max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="px-4 md:px-6 pt-6 md:pt-10 pb-4">
      <div class="bg-card rounded-3xl shadow-card p-5 md:p-7">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/33626391783"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full py-4 bg-whatsapp text-white rounded-2xl font-bold text-base no-underline mb-3"
        >
          <span data-lang="en">Message on WhatsApp</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Message sur WhatsApp</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Mensaje por WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:contact@savornstories.com"
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full py-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-green to-teal text-white rounded-2xl font-bold text-sm no-underline"
        >
          contact@savornstories.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="px-4 md:px-6 pb-8 md:pb-10 text-sm md:text-base text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
      <p data-lang="en">
        Tell me which city, roughly how many people, and what dates you have in mind, and I will get back to you with times that work. If you're not sure which tour fits, just describe what you're after and I'll point you the right way.
      </p>
      <p data-lang="fr" hidden>
        Dites-moi quelle ville, à peu près combien de personnes, et quelles dates vous avez en tête, et je reviendrai vers vous avec des horaires qui conviennent. Si vous ne savez pas quelle visite choisir, décrivez simplement ce que vous cherchez et je vous orienterai.
      </p>
      <p data-lang="es" hidden>
        Dime qué ciudad, aproximadamente cuántas personas y qué fechas tienes en mente, y te responderé con horarios que funcionen. Si no estás seguro de qué tour te conviene, simplemente describe lo que buscas y te orientaré.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="px-4 md:px-6 pb-8 md:pb-14">
      <p class="eyebrow text-center mb-4">
        <span data-lang="en">Antoine's card</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>La carte d'Antoine</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>La tarjeta de Antoine</span>
      </p>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 md:gap-6">
        <img src="/assets/savorstories-logo.png" alt="The front of Antoine's card" class="w-28 md:w-36 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-sm" />
        <img src="/assets/savorstories-card-back.png" alt="The back of Antoine's card, with a QR code to this site" class="w-28 md:w-36 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-sm" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-base text-label text-center mt-3">
        <span data-lang="en">This is the card he hands out, front and back. Same site either way you got here.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Voici la carte qu'il distribue, recto et verso. Vous arrivez au même endroit, quel que soit le chemin.</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Esta es la tarjeta que reparte, delante y detrás. Llegas al mismo sitio, sea como sea que hayas llegado.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
